{
  "_comment": [
    "One banned-term list for the UI copy linter (frontend/src/utils/copyLinter.ts) and Loti's output guardrail (ai_coach/safety_guardrails.py).",
    "`shared` must match BANNED_RULES in copyLinter.ts rule for rule; tests/test_coach_module.py checks it. Edit both together until the frontend reads this file.",
    "`coach_only` holds extra checks on Loti's generated replies (U5: no brain regions, no chemicals, no neuroplasticity; no transfer, comparison or health claims). The frontend may adopt them later.",
    "`pattern` is a JavaScript RegExp source; `flags` are its flags. The Python side ignores `g` and maps `i` to re.IGNORECASE.",
    "`replacementSuggestion` is a hint for copy authors. The coach never substitutes it into text: a reply that trips a rule is withheld, not rewritten."
  ],
  "shared": [
